{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-diagram-lightbox",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-diagram-lightbox&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "styles": [
    ".demo { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }",
    "    .demo-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }",
    "    .demo-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }",
    "    .demo-bar iswc-select { min-width: 12rem; }",
    "    .pill {",
    "      display: inline-flex;",
    "      align-items: center;",
    "      gap: 0.35rem;",
    "      padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;",
    "      border-radius: 999px;",
    "      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-accent) 14%, transparent);",
    "      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-accent) 30%, transparent);",
    "      color: var(--iswc-accent);",
    "      font-size: 0.72rem;",
    "      font-weight: 700;",
    "      letter-spacing: 0.04em;",
    "      text-transform: uppercase;",
    "    }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-diagram-lightbox",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Visor a pantalla completa pensado para diagramas: hereda del",
        "          <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-lightbox&gt;</code> genérico el zoom anclado al",
        "          cursor, el pan y el dialog top-layer, y le suma la barra de la animación",
        "          tortuga (play / pause / prev / next), el anillo de auto-replay, el panel",
        "          de código JSON y el enlace compartible con el payload en <code class=\"code\">?d=</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"demo-bar\">",
            "            <span class=\"pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Demo</span>",
            "            <iswc-select id=\"preset\" label=\"Preset\" value=\"tk1437191\">",
            "              <iswc-option value=\"tk1437191\" label=\"Facturación electrónica\"></iswc-option>",
            "              <iswc-option value=\"tk1431662\" label=\"Onboarding de cliente\"></iswc-option>",
            "            </iswc-select>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"openViewer\" color=\"brand\" variant=\"filled\">",
            "              Abrir el visor",
            "              <iswc-icon slot=\"end\" icon=\"mdi:arrow-right\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <iswc-diagram-lightbox id=\"lb\" kind=\"sequence\"></iswc-diagram-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "API",
      "lede": [
        "Configura el diagrama con <code class=\"code\">payload</code> (objeto JS) o con",
        "          un <code class=\"code\">&lt;script type=\"application/json\"&gt;</code> hijo, y abre",
        "          con <code class=\"code\">open = true</code> o el método <code class=\"code\">show()</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "API",
            "Detalle"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">kind</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">\"sequence\"</code> por defecto. Hoy sólo diagrama de secuencia; la barra se adapta a la API turtle del nodo."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">payload</code>",
              "Objeto con la configuración del diagrama (<code class=\"code\">preset</code>, <code class=\"code\">sequence</code>, etc.)."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">open</code> · <code class=\"code\">show()</code> · <code class=\"code\">hide()</code>",
              "Visibilidad del dialog."
            ],
            [
              "Hereda de <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-lightbox&gt;</code>",
              "zoom, pan, slot <code class=\"code\">toolbar</code>, eventos <code class=\"code\">iswc-open</code>, <code class=\"code\">iswc-close</code>, <code class=\"code\">iswc-reposition</code>, <code class=\"code\">iswc-share</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">iswc-turtle-state</code>",
              "detail: <code class=\"code\">{ playing, idx, total, replay }</code>"
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">iswc-toggle-group</code>",
              "detail: <code class=\"code\">{ id }</code> — clic en una leyenda de grupo del diagrama."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": [
            "<iswc-diagram-lightbox id=\"lb\" kind=\"sequence\"></iswc-diagram-lightbox>",
            "",
            "<script type=\"module\">",
            "  const lb = document.getElementById('lb');",
            "  lb.payload = { preset: 'tk1437191' };",
            "  lb.open = true;",
            "",
            "  // O abrirlo con un click:",
            "  lb.addEventListener('iswc-share', (e) => {",
            "    console.log('Compartir:', e.detail.url);",
            "  });",
            "</script>"
          ],
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
